    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hentai Puzzle: Tropical Seduction is a fun puzzle game that challenges your intelligence and attention! Set in the enchanting atmosphere of a tropical summer vacation, this game lets you feel the warmth of the sun, the coolness of the sea, and the allure of the beaches while putting together scenes featuring vibrant and captivating anime girls. The energy of the holiday and the beauty of tropical islands make each puzzle even more enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277750/extras/93a74f9f7a8d0ed4300193adb9d3da79.avif?t=1733761607\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is visually impressive, filled with eye-catching tropical-themed anime characters. Each completed puzzle rewards players with beautiful scenes and lets you experience the spirit of the vacation through its visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277750/extras/44e9466b9ea5d311a2174005fc7b2a8b.avif?t=1733761607\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hentai Puzzle: Tropical Seduction offers an addictive gameplay experience. With simple and immersive mechanics, it provides an enjoyable experience that will take you to a completely different world with its tropical holiday theme.</p>",
